{
  "source": "Prompts/what-is-ai-v13.mp4",
  "duration": 152.4053125,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.82,
      "text": "You need to start your next history project, but you haven't picked a topic."
    },
    {
      "start": 4.52,
      "end": 6.12,
      "text": "You look around the room for inspiration."
    },
    {
      "start": 6.88,
      "end": 10.48,
      "text": "Ask your desk, give me 10 ideas for my next history project."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.38,
      "end": 12.98,
      "text": "Nothing. It's a desk."
    },
    {
      "start": 13.86,
      "end": 16.26,
      "text": "Ask a friend, and they can help you brainstorm."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.28,
      "end": 20.32,
      "text": "Ask AI, and it can give you a list in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 21.2,
      "end": 24.74,
      "text": "AI is software built to do things that used to take a human brain."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.48,
      "end": 28.5,
      "text": "It can understand a question, summarize a long document,"
    },
    {
      "start": 28.5,
      "end": 30.2,
      "text": "or translate a conversation."
    },
    {
      "start": 31.24,
      "end": 33.36,
      "text": "That doesn't mean it actually thinks like your friend,"
    },
    {
      "start": 33.88,
      "end": 36.44,
      "text": "or that all 10 of those history ideas will be good."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.22,
      "end": 41.84,
      "text": "You simply have a tool that can help with cognitive tasks that once required a person."
    },
    {
      "start": 42.72,
      "end": 46.92,
      "text": "AI left the realm of science fiction years ago to become part of your daily routine."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.6,
      "end": 52.32,
      "text": "It operates the apps on your phone and powers the tools your first job will hand you on day one."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.98,
      "end": 55.74,
      "text": "Most of what it does today, it will do better tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "start": 56.58,
      "end": 62.0,
      "text": "This graphic shows a breakdown of exactly where AI already lives in your daily routine."
    },
    {
      "start": 62.78,
      "end": 66.02,
      "text": "First, it recommends media by predicting what you might like next."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.56,
      "end": 69.42,
      "text": "You interact with this on Spotify, Netflix, and TikTok."
    },
    {
      "start": 70.82,
      "end": 75.86,
      "text": "Second, navigation tools predict traffic and your arrival time on apps like Google Maps and Waze."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.16,
      "end": 79.38,
      "text": "Third, face recognition validates your identity,"
    },
    {
      "start": 79.38,
      "end": 82.88,
      "text": "checking whether a face matches you for phone unlocks and photo tagging."
    },
    {
      "start": 83.7,
      "end": 89.26,
      "text": "Fourth, voice assistants turn your speech into words when you talk to Siri, Alexa, or Hey Google."
    },
    {
      "start": 90.02,
      "end": 96.52,
      "text": "Finally, chatbots carry on direct conversations with you through programs like chat GPT, Claude, and Gemini."
    },
    {
      "start": 97.66,
      "end": 100.32,
      "text": "Looking at this complete picture shows us something clear."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.18,
      "end": 103.92,
      "text": "AI was already part of your day before chatbots arrived."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.74,
      "end": 106.18,
      "text": "Different AI systems do different jobs."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.96,
      "end": 108.7,
      "text": "Let's look at two kinds you already use."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.46,
      "end": 112.26,
      "text": "This graphic breaks down these tools into two main categories."
    },
    {
      "start": 113.24,
      "end": 115.0,
      "text": "First, is recommendation AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 116.02,
      "end": 118.04,
      "text": "Its job is to choose from what already exists."
    },
    {
      "start": 118.82,
      "end": 123.48,
      "text": "It works by ranking the available options and selecting the likely best match for you."
    },
    {
      "start": 124.2,
      "end": 129.2,
      "text": "You see this every day when you get a suggested Netflix show, a Spotify song, or a maps route."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.3,
      "end": 131.56,
      "text": "Then there is generative AI."
    },
    {
      "start": 132.58,
      "end": 134.3,
      "text": "Its job is to make something that didn't exist."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.3,
      "end": 138.22,
      "text": "A prompt is simply the question or set of instructions you give it."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.02,
      "end": 145.3,
      "text": "This can result in a brand new email, an essay, an image, a website, a song, or a video."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.36,
      "end": 148.88,
      "text": "AI can recommend AI can create."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.8,
      "end": 151.58,
      "text": "This course focuses on generative AI."
    }
  ],
